      {
         "id": "SECTION_prerequisites",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "<p><span id=\"htZoomImageMsg\"></span></p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "### Prerequisites\n\nIn this text, we continue the study begun in the previous work (<htcite0>) on how Indigenous peoples may have carried out mathematical operations in Mesoamerica (Figure 1). There we added Mesoamerican numbers; here we multiply them. Before you continue, we recommend reading **Chapter 4** of the *First Steps* section (<htcite1>), where multiplication is presented as repeated addition.",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "fa7eaa91-aafb-4974-82cb-f2a895d5c44a",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
                     "page": "Mesoamerican sums",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2025",
                        "month": "-1",
                        "day": "-1"
                     }
                  },
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "b5efc8f9-c268-430f-9681-7a43848ee48e",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
                     "page": "First steps (Volume 1)",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2024",
                        "month": "-1",
                        "day": "-1"
                     }
                  }
               ],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p class=\"desc\"><img id=\"imgMA\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('imgMA', '0%')\"  class=\"imgcenter\"/><b>Figure 1</b>: Map of Mesoamerica according to Creamer’s research (<htcite0>)</p>",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "2d720f02-051c-4469-b425-7d020f2c2f9b",
                     "text": "Creamer, W.",
                     "page": "pp. 37 - 55,",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "1987",
                        "month": "10",
                        "day": "27"
                     }
                  }
               ],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
